Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "WildlifeEncounterInRain" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :gorilla1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :rainy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:gorilla1 a :Actor ;
    :description "Gorilla moving across the road" .

:rainy1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Large animal obstructing the lane of travel" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Lane intrusion caused by a large animal (gorilla) crossing the road in poor weather conditions, creating a high risk of collision.
Severity Score: 0.95